            <description><![CDATA[<p>In the Arctic, ice is both all around and constantly disappearing. “Utuqaq” explores climate change from the perspective of this beautiful and vital element, as four researchers embark on an expedition to drill ice cores in subzero temperatures. </p>
<p>Narrated in Kalaallisut (West Greenlandic) by Aviaja Lyberth.</p>]]></description>
